          233.0,
          895.0,
          471.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The polymers were synthesized by free-radical solution addition polymerization from the respective monomers using AIBN as an initiator in THF at $6 0 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$for 48 h. The typical procedure for the synthesis of polymer ia is as follows: The monomer ia (400 mg, 0.67 mol) and AIBN (2 wt %) were dissolved in dry THF (5 mL) and gentle steam ofnitrogen purged into the solution. The solution was kept in an oil bath at $6 0 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$for 48 h. Then, the solution was cooled and poured into excess of methanol to precipitate the product."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
    },
