        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The polymer was dissolved in chloroform, filtered with 0.45 nm syringe filter, and then spin-coated at 1000 rpm on to sonicated quartz slide and annealed around their $T _ { \\mathrm { g } }$to yield dry amorphous film of good optical quality."
